  <text id="title" x="110" y="135" width="510" height="132" font="display" size="48" color="primary" line-height="1.05"><p>Autonomous buying</p><p>needs controls.</p></text>
  <text id="proposition" x="110" y="310" width="500" height="110" font="body" size="24" color="ink" line-height="1.35">A recommendation cannot authorize a purchase. Procurement must retain specification, delivery, budget, availability, and approval boundaries.</text>
  <text id="footer-note" x="110" y="585" width="480" height="44" font="caption" size="15" color="muted" line-height="1.35">Specanic converts an ordinary-language request into an inspectable decision record.</text>
  <shape id="risk-card-brief" type="rect" x="700" y="145" width="480" height="112" fill="surface" stroke="hairline" stroke-width="1"/>
  <icon id="brief-icon" name="file-text" x="728" y="177" width="34" height="34" color="accent"/>
  <text id="brief-card" x="790" y="166" width="350" height="72" font="body" color="ink" line-height="1.3"><p font="heading" size="21">Brief ambiguity</p><p size="16" color="muted">Natural language can omit constraints that change the decision.</p></text>
  <shape id="risk-card-vendor" type="rect" x="700" y="286" width="480" height="112" fill="surface" stroke="hairline" stroke-width="1"/>
  <icon id="vendor-icon" name="search" x="728" y="318" width="34" height="34" color="accent"/>
  <text id="vendor-card" x="790" y="307" width="350" height="72" font="body" color="ink" line-height="1.3"><p font="heading" size="21">Vendor variance</p><p size="16" color="muted">Price alone hides stock, delivery, reliability, and return risk.</p></text>
